{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"],"type":"conformingTypes","title":"Conforming Types","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/event"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use events to decouple the code that notices something from the code that responds to it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a physics step sends a collision, and separate damage and sound systems each read it. Declare"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an event as a type that conforms to "},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", send it with "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/send(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and read it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/readEvents(_:by:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct Collision: Event { var first: Entity, second: Entity }","enum DamageReader {}","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Health(current: 3))","let asteroid = world.spawn(Health(current: 1))","world.send(Collision(first: ship, second: asteroid))","","for collision in world.readEvents(Collision.self, by: DamageReader.self) {","    world[Health.self, of: collision.first].current -= 1","}","print(world[Health.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Health(current: 2)\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Events wait in the world’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events"},{"type":"text","text":" resource until "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/updateEvents()"},{"type":"text","text":" drops them,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so senders and readers don’t need to run at the same moment. Unlike an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent"},{"type":"text","text":", an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event isn’t aimed at an entity and runs no code when sent."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Protocol","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"symbolKind":"protocol","title":"Event","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Events.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Events.swift#L27"},"externalID":"s:11WorldModule5EventP","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events"